flowchart LR
 _Prelude_(["Find the stripper and intimidate her into handing over any incriminating evidence."])
 _A0_(["The team lines up to enter the seedy strip club."])
 _A1_(["Reaching the entrance, the crew is halted by the bouncer."])
 _A1_1_(["He asks Enforcer if the team is here for a good time or to cause trouble."])
 _A1_C1_{"Enforcer tries to convince the bouncer that they&#39;re all respectable citizens."}
 _A1_C1F_["The bouncer buys it until Enforcer calls the strippers “spicy hoochie mamas.”"]
 _A1_C2_{"Muscle #1 tries to convince the bouncer it was a joke, apologizing profusely."}
 _A1_C2F_["The bouncer warns that this is a classy joint, and an expensive one."]
 _A1_C3_{"Muscle #2 flashes a money clip, saying they&#39;re ready to throw down serious cash."}
 _A1_C3P_["The bouncer smirks and allows the team to enter, realizing they&#39;ll be good for business."]
 _A2_(["Wandering inside, the crew takes up a row of seats at the bar, remaining casual."])
 _A2_1_(["The bartender locks eyes with Muscle #1 and asks him what he wants to drink."])
 _A2_C1_{"Muscle #1 orders a Bee&#39;s Knees and casually asks if Honey is working tonight."}
 _A2_C1F_["The bartender, now suspicious, asks why he&#39;s so interested in Honey."]
 _A2_C2_{"Enforcer quips that everyone needs a little sweetness in their lives."}
 _A2_C2F_["The bartender frowns, pointing out that Muscle #1 hasn&#39;t answered his question."]
 _A2_C3_{"Muscle #2 declares the team should leave and find a more welcoming establishment."}
 _A2_C3P_["The bartender relents, revealing that Honey is booked for a private function in the back."]
 _A3_(["He invites the crew to watch Mercia instead, reassuring them she&#39;s less trouble."])
 _A3_1_(["Drinks in hand, the crew heads through to watch the performance."])
 _A3_2_(["A scantily clad woman, presumably Mercia, struts out onto the stage."])
 _A3_3_(["Mercia wastes no time in gyrating aggressively against the stripper pole."])
 _A3_C1_{"Enforcer pulls out a wad of notes, trying to tempt her over."}
 _A3_C1P_["Impressed by Enforcer&#39;s large wad, Mercia turns her full attention to her."]
 _A4_(["Muscle #2 stuffs cash into Mercia&#39;s thong, whispering the name #quot;Honey#quot; in her ear."])
 _A4_Cont_(["Rolling her eyes, Mercia grumbles #quot;The Ruby Suite#quot; before returning to the pole."])
 _A4_1_(["The team strolls through to the back of the club in search of the Ruby Suite."])
 _A4_2_(["Following a pig-like grunting noise, they find the room they&#39;re looking for."])
 _A4_3_(["The team bursts into the room to find Honey cavorting with an older gentleman."])
 _A4_C1_{"Enforcer threatens the man and demands that he leave the room."}
 _A4_C1P_["With the integrity of his testicles threatened, the client gathers his stuff and leaves."]
 _A5_(["As Honey starts to complain, Enforcer clamps a hand over her mouth."])
 _A5_1_(["Enforcer tells her that she&#39;s blackmailed the wrong people and it ends tonight."])
 _A5_1_Cont_(["Honey breaks down in tears and explains that she was forced to do it by her boss."])
 _A5_C1_{"Muscle #2 comforts Honey, insisting they can protect her from repercussions."}
 _A5_C1F_["Skeptical about Muscle #2&#39;s claim, Honey makes a run for it but is swiftly caught."]
 _A5_C2_{"Muscle #1 threatens to cut Honey&#39;s pretty face if she fails to comply."}
 _A5_C2P_["Shivering in fear, Honey agrees to help them retrieve the blackmail material."]
 _A6_1_(["She puts on a robe and leads the team through to the boss&#39;s office."])
 _A6_1_Cont_(["Honey knocks and the door opens to reveal a gigantic guard, his neck as wide as a tree."])
 _A6_C2_{"Muscle #2 tries to shove their thumbs into the strongman&#39;s eyes."}
 _A6_C2F_["The guard resists the blinding attempt and the two goons grapple, choking each other out."]
 _A6_7_(["The rest of the team presses onward, hunting for someone who can open the safe."])
 _A6_8_(["Concerned that she&#39;s leading them into a trap, Honey is made to go first."])
 _A6_9_(["Honey protests, calling for her boss&#39;s help and drawing the attention of a bodyguard."])
 _A6_10_(["The team gets into a brawl, allowing the boss to slip away."])
 _A6_11_(["Muscle #1 chases the boss as Enforcer keeps the bodyguard at bay."])
 _A6_12_(["Enforcer is stabbed but retaliates by smashing the guard&#39;s head into a radiator."])
 _A6_13_(["The team pins down the club boss, forcing him to hand over the blackmail evidence."])
 _A6_14_(["The boss retrieves the file from the safe and gives it up without further protest."])
 _A6S_(["With its objective secured, the team rescues Muscle #2 and leaves."])
 _A3_C1F_["Unimpressed by Enforcer&#39;s wad, Mercia is drawn over by another customer."]
 _A3_7_(["The stripper finishes her show and engages in a private dance with a high-rolling client."])
 _B1_(["Undeterred, the team walks over, offering to pay Mercia double for her time."])
 _B1_1_(["Mercia rejects the offer, calling for Honey, who&#39;s available now the function&#39;s over."])
 _B1_2_(["The team asks Honey for a private encounter, offering her a significant sum."])
 _B1_3_(["Honey smiles, says she likes a good workout, and invites the team to follow her."])
 _B1_4_(["Upon entering the private room, Muscle #2 locks the door and stands guard."])
 _B1_C1_{"Muscle #2 declares that Honey&#39;s blackmailing days are over, urging her to confess."}
 _B1_C1P_["Honey starts sobbing, claiming she was threatened and had to do it to survive."]
 _B2_(["Muscle #2 insists they will leave her unharmed if she hands over the evidence."])
 _B2_1_(["Honey complies, leading the team to the boss&#39;s office."])
 _B2_2_(["She knocks on the door and an unfathomably huge guard answers."])
 _B2_3_(["Honey cries for help and the boss calls for his guards to handle the situation."])
 _B2_C1_{"Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 try to defeat the guards before any more arrive."}
 _B2_C1F_["While Muscle #2 downs one guard, Muscle #1 is choked unconscious."]
 _B2_7_(["Muscle #2 approaches the remaining guard but stops short when he pulls out a gun."])
 _B2_C2_{"Risking her life, Muscle #2 charges at the guard and leaps on him."}
 _B2_C2F_["The bodyguard reacts quicker than Muscle #2, shooting her in the knee."]
 _B2_6_(["With his teammates out of action, Enforcer is cornered and surrenders."])
 _B2F_(["The club boss gives Enforcer a severe beating, putting an end to the mission."])
 _B1_C1F_["Honey fakes ignorance, insisting she doesn&#39;t do role play, and starts to dance sensually."]
 _B1_C2_{"Tired of the games, Muscle #2 points a gun at Honey, demanding the truth."}
 _B1_C2P_["Honey bursts into tears and admits everything but claims her boss gave her no choice."]
 _B2_C1P_["The guards are beaten bloody, giving the team free reign to intimidate the club boss."]
 _B3_(["Enforcer reveals what Honey told him and demands the blackmail file."])
 _B3_1_(["Cursing his loose-lipped employee, the boss retrieves the file from his safe."])
 _B3_2_(["As the crew leaves with the evidence, the boss shoots Enforcer in the back."])
 _B3_3_(["Before he can squeeze off another shot, Muscle #2 fires back, taking the boss out."])
 _B3_4_(["Enforcer is dragged to his feet and carried to safety through the back door."])
 _B2S_(["The team escapes from the scene without incurring further injuries."])
 _A1_C3F_["Concerned about their attitude, the bouncer tells the team to try somewhere else tonight."]
 _A1F_(["When more doormen show up, the message is received and the gang gives up."])
 _A2_C1P_["The bartender reveals she&#39;s booked for a private show all night long."]
 _A1_C1P_["The bouncer lets them in, warning them to look, not touch, or he&#39;ll break their fingers."]
 _A2_C2P_["This joke eases the tension but the bartender says Honey is booked for a private show."]
 _A4_C1F_["The client maintains he’s paid for his time and tells the team to wait their turn."]
 _A4_C2_{"Muscle #1 says Honey is best avoided as Muscle #2 cites “health issues.”"}
 _A4_C2P_["Worried about his own venereal health, the client dresses and bolts from the room."]
 _A5_2_(["When Honey raises a complaint, Muscle #2 tells her to shut her pie hole."])
 _A5_3_(["Enforcer reveals he knows of her blackmailing habit and demands the evidence."])
 _A6_C2P_["As he shrieks in agony, the team is finally able to overpower the musclebound guard."]
 _A7_(["Honey tries to open the boss&#39;s floor safe but the usual combination doesn&#39;t work!"])
 _A7_Cont1_(["She says that she can ask a colleague for the new code, telling the team to follow her."])
 _A7_Cont2_(["Muscle #2 stays put to keep watch while Honey leads the others through the club."])
 _A7_1_(["Honey halts at the dressing room door and calls out to see if anyone’s inside."])
 _A7_2_(["Suddenly, the strip club boss turns the corner, flanked by two bodyguards!"])
 _A7_3_(["The team immediately engages with the guards, brawling in the corridor."])
 _A7_4_(["Amid the chaos, the club boss slips through, making a break for his office."])
 _A7_5_(["Seeing Muscle #2 lurking, the boss bolts for the back door."])
 _A7_5_Cont_(["Muscle #2 races after him, calling the crew to intercept before the boss escapes."])
 _A7_C1_{"Enforcer and Muscle #1 rush outside, ready to fight any guards who follow."}
 _A7_C1P_["The guards are cut down in seconds, walking right into the kill zone."]
 _A8_(["Without his protection, the boss offers the team whatever they want to spare his life."])
 _A8_Cont1_(["Muscle #2 demands the blackmail file, promising to take his tongue if he refuses."])
 _A8_Cont2_(["The boss leads the team into his office, where he retrieves the file from the floor safe."])
 _A8S_(["With the evidence in hand, the boss is knocked out and the team slips away."])
 _A1_C2P_["With impatience, the bouncer moves aside, warning them to leave the jokes at the door."]
 _A7_C1F_["The team&#39;s attack on the guards is poorly timed and the boss almost escapes in the melee."]
 _A7_12_(["Muscle #2 is forced to take the boss hostage to make the guards comply."])
 _A7_13_(["The team demands that the blackmail evidence is handed over before he is released."])
 _A7_14_(["Following the boss’s orders, one guard steps inside to retrieve the blackmail file."])
 _A7_15_(["Sneakily, he grabs only some of the evidence, retaining a few incriminating images."])
 _A7S_(["The handoff occurs and the team leaves, unaware the mission is only partially complete."])
 _A5_C2F_["Honey feigns compliance before slashing at Muscle #1 with a blade of her own."]
 _A5_4_(["The team is unable to stop the stripper from screaming, drawing the bouncers&#39; attention."])
 _A5F_(["Exposed and overpowered, the team is thrown out, leaving the blackmail evidence behind."])
 _A5_C1P_["The stripper, reassured, says she knows where the blackmail material is hidden."]
 _A6_(["She fixes her clothes and leads them through to the boss&#39;s office."])
 _A6_Cont_(["Honey knocks and the door opens to reveal a hefty guard, his frame filling the doorway."])
 _A6_C1_{"Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 rush to overwhelm the man before he can react."}
 _A6_C1P_["The team subdues the burly bruiser with speed and force, knocking him out cold."]
 _A6_C1F_["Though caught off guard, the brute recovers swiftly, prolonging the fight."]
 _B1_C2F_["The threat backfires as the stripper screams loudly, calling for help."]
 _B1_5_(["The team tries to flee but the bouncers quickly cut them off."])
 _B1F_(["The team&#39;s plan falls apart as they are thrown out of the club for harassment."])
 _B2_C2P_["The final guard is coldcocked, leaving nobody to defend the club boss."]
 _A4_C2F_["Boiling with anger, the naked man lunges at the team, fists swinging."]
 _A4_6_(["Enforcer shoves the man away, causing him to stumble and hit his head."])
 _A4_6_Cont_(["Realizing his neck is broken, Honey screams, alerting the club&#39;s security team."])
 _A4F_(["The team is forced to fight its way out, abandoning its mission entirely."])
 _A2_C3F_["Unfazed, the bartender tells the crew they&#39;re going nowhere while signaling for backup."]
 _A2F_(["The bouncers close in, interrogate the team, and throw them off the premises."])

